        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hydra Heli</strong> is a short, relaxing incremental experience. Control a swarm of torpedoes to destroy battleships and use the currency gained to improve your helicopter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Direct Torpedoes</strong> to smash into battleships and earn shards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858850/extras/06ca1c41f0dcd77bf6f9b8efda40e456.poster.avif?t=1785328480\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858850/extras/06ca1c41f0dcd77bf6f9b8efda40e456.webm?t=1785328480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858850/extras/06ca1c41f0dcd77bf6f9b8efda40e456.mp4?t=1785328480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spend Shards </strong>to boost damage, increase firepower, and unlock new regions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858850/extras/bc2d64bc4bb45c73a9f5b57f5fb12ca1.poster.avif?t=1785328480\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858850/extras/bc2d64bc4bb45c73a9f5b57f5fb12ca1.webm?t=1785328480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858850/extras/bc2d64bc4bb45c73a9f5b57f5fb12ca1.mp4?t=1785328480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you find a way to save your country from annihilation?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying  incremental progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing short ~3 hour experience </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A massive skill tree to progress through </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 regions to discover</p></li></ul>",
